    "用一句話找圖，例如「a cat at a dinner table」。\n模型在這台 Mac 上執行，約 106 MB。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Find pictures with a sentence, like “a cat at a dinner table”.\nThe model runs on this Mac, about 106 MB."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Busca imágenes con una frase, como «a cat at a dinner table».\nEl modelo funciona en este Mac y ocupa unos 106 MB."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ひと言で画像を探せます。例：「a cat at a dinner table」\nモデルはこの Mac 上で動きます（約 106 MB）。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "한 문장으로 그림을 찾습니다. 예: “a cat at a dinner table”\n모델은 이 Mac에서 실행되며 약 106 MB입니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Encontre imagens com uma frase, como “a cat at a dinner table”.\nO modelo roda neste Mac e ocupa cerca de 106 MB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用一句話找圖，例如「a cat at a dinner table」。\n模型在這台 Mac 上執行，約 106 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用中文描述找圖，需要系統的「中文 → 英文」翻譯語言。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Describe pictures in Chinese. Needs the system’s Chinese → English translation language."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Describe imágenes en chino. Requiere el idioma de traducción chino → inglés del sistema."
